===SYSTEM===
You are a senior frontend architect. Generate the complete frontend implementation asset from the frontend ChangeSet, UX, UI, API contract, and backend constraints. Only use the frontend implementation fields defined in `新特征设计.md`.

You must output a strict JSON object only. Do not output Markdown, explanatory prose, comments, or business code.

===USER===
Input:
  - task: {{ task }}
  - layer: {{ layer }}
  - project_config:
  - {{ project_config | tojson_pretty }}
  - selected_story:
  - {{ selected_story | tojson_pretty }}
  - change_set:
  - {{ change_set | tojson_pretty }}
  - previous_version:
  - {{ previous_version | tojson_pretty }}
  - related_assets:
  - {{ related_assets | tojson_pretty }}

Input Fields:
  - task: string, fixed task name generate_design_asset.
  - layer: string, fixed to frontend_pages.
  - project_config: object, project configuration and frontend stack.
  - selected_story: object or null, the business story driving this generation.
  - change_set: object, apply every item in change_set.module_changes.frontend_pages added, modified, and removed.
  - previous_version: object or null, the previous frontend implementation asset.
  - related_assets: object, read ux_design, ui_design, api_contract, and backend_services.

Output Fields:
  - title: string, frontend implementation asset title.
  - summary: string, frontend implementation summary.
  - content.version_summary: string, version summary.
  - content.environment_variables: array with variable_name, variable_description, default_value.
  - content.route_definitions: array with route_name, route_path, route_params, route_target_component.
  - content.directory_structure: array with path and purpose.
  - content.layout_library: string, layout library description.
  - content.component_library: string, component library description.
  - content.dependency_package_management: array with package_name and package_description.
  - content.page_code_logic: array with target and logic_description.
  - content.frontend_interfaces: array with interface_name and interface_description.
  - content.diff: object with added, modified, removed.
  - diff_from_previous: object with added, modified, removed.

Output Rules:
  - Output only the fields above. Do not output pages, components, data_flow, internal_utilities, install_commands, design_theme, dependencies, required, page_name, dynamic_params, or permission_requirement.
  - Route definitions may only use route_name, route_path, route_params, and route_target_component.
  - Environment variables may only use variable_name, variable_description, and default_value.
  - Do not repeat large UX/UI prose and do not generate business code.
  - Output a strict JSON object only.

Example Input [1]:
{"layer":"frontend_pages","related_assets":{"ux_design":{"summary":"low-stock flow"},"ui_design":{"summary":"inventory visual system"},"api_contract":{"summary":"inventory API"},"backend_services":{"summary":"inventory service"}}}

Example Output [1]:
{"title":"Low-stock frontend implementation","summary":"Defines the frontend implementation for the low-stock page.","content":{"version_summary":"Adds the low-stock page implementation plan.","environment_variables":[{"variable_name":"NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL","variable_description":"Frontend API base URL","default_value":""}],"route_definitions":[{"route_name":"Low-stock inventory page","route_path":"/inventory/low-stock","route_params":[],"route_target_component":"LowStockPage"}],"directory_structure":[{"path":"src/app/inventory/low-stock/page.tsx","purpose":"Page entry point"}],"layout_library":"Compact list layout.","component_library":"Inventory row and status components.","dependency_package_management":[{"package_name":"lucide-react","package_description":"Action icons"}],"page_code_logic":[{"target":"LowStockPage","logic_description":"Load the list and handle empty, error, and replenishment states."}],"frontend_interfaces":[],"diff":{"added":["low-stock page"],"modified":[],"removed":[]}},"diff_from_previous":{"added":["low-stock frontend implementation"],"modified":[],"removed":[]}}
